  "description": "Reid Comfort 700c | Comfort city bike\nComfortable, relaxed and easy to ride – a versatile comfort bike designed for everyday cycling, city streets, cycle paths and light trails.\nThe Reid Bikes Comfort 700c is designed for effortless everyday riding, with a lightweight alloy frame and relaxed geometry that creates a comfortable, upright riding position. This helps reduce fatigue while providing a stable and enjoyable ride, whether you're navigating city streets, cycle paths or smoother trails.\nA Shimano 7-speed drivetrain with intuitive RevoShift shifters provides simple and reliable gear changes, making it easy to find the right gear for everyday riding and gentle inclines.\nThe larger 700c wheels provide an efficient and smooth roll, while grippy 38C tyres offer a good balance of comfort, stability and traction across roads and light trails. A comfort saddle helps absorb road vibration and adds further support on longer rides.\nAn adjustable stem and ergonomic riser handlebars allow you to fine-tune your riding position for a more personalised and comfortable fit. Dependable alloy V-brakes provide confident and controlled stopping when riding around town or on shared paths.\nWith its lightweight frame, relaxed geometry, 700c wheels and comfort-focused components, the Reid Bikes Comfort 700c is an easy and enjoyable choice for everyday journeys, leisure rides and anyone looking to enjoy cycling at their own pace.\nThe Reid Bikes Comfort 700c is ideal for:\n\nEveryday cycling – a relaxed, upright riding position designed for comfort and reduced fatigue\n\nCity and urban riding – stable 700c wheels and responsive handling make it well suited to everyday journeys\n\nLeisurely rides – comfort-focused geometry and components make longer rides more enjoyable\n\nCycle paths and light trails – grippy 38C tyres provide comfort and traction across a variety of smoother surfaces\n\nSimple, reliable gearing – Shimano 7-speed gearing with RevoShift shifters makes changing gears easy and intuitive\n\nA personalised riding position – an adjustable stem and ergonomic riser handlebars allow you to fine-tune your fit\n\nSmooth, efficient riding – larger 700c wheels provide a comfortable and efficient roll across roads and mixed surfaces\n\nComfort-focused riding – a plush comfort saddle helps absorb road vibration and provides additional support\n\nConfident stopping – dependable alloy V-brakes offer controlled and reliable braking.\n\nEveryday errands and weekend rides – a versatile and easy-going bike for getting around town or enjoying more miles at your own pace",
